{"probes":[{"id":"thanos-metrics-contract","summary":"Read-only contract checks completed across all four nodes.","cleanup_completed":true,"limitations":[]},{"id":"thanos-operational-state","summary":"Read-only operational-state checks completed across all four nodes.","cleanup_completed":true,"limitations":[]}],"assertions":[{"id":"thanos-two-replicas-scrape-all-hosts","status":"pass","summary":"Both Prometheus replicas have unique replica labels and actively scrape all four node-exporter targets.","evidence":[{"node":"node1","command":"curl -fsS --max-time 8 http://127.0.0.1:9090/api/v1/status/config","observation":"Configuration reported external_labels replica: node1 and node/node-exporter scrape configuration."},{"node":"node1","command":"curl -fsS --max-time 8 http://127.0.0.1:9090/api/v1/targets","observation":"activeTargets contained node1:9100, node2:9100, node3:9100, node4:9100, and the Prometheus target; every target was health up with an empty lastError and recent lastScrape."},{"node":"node2","command":"curl -fsS --max-time 8 http://127.0.0.1:9090/api/v1/status/config","observation":"Configuration reported external_labels replica: node2 and node/node-exporter scrape configuration."},{"node":"node2","command":"curl -fsS --max-time 8 http://127.0.0.1:9090/api/v1/targets","observation":"activeTargets contained node1:9100, node2:9100, node3:9100, node4:9100, and the Prometheus target; every target was health up with an empty lastError and recent lastScrape."}],"failures":[],"limitations":[]},{"id":"thanos-query-deduplicates-and-retains","status":"pass","summary":"Node3 exposes both Prometheus sidecars and the object-store-backed store, returns four deduplicated current host series, and returns older samples from retained blocks.","evidence":[{"node":"node3","command":"ps -eo pid=,comm=,args= | grep \"[t]hanos\"","observation":"Running processes included Thanos query with --query.replica-label=replica and endpoints node1:10901, node2:10901, and the local store; store and compact processes were also present."},{"node":"node3","command":"curl -fsS --max-time 8 http://127.0.0.1:10902/api/v1/stores","observation":"Query API reported healthy sidecars node1:10901 and node2:10901 with replica labels node1/node2, plus a healthy store entry with lastError null."},{"node":"node3","command":"curl -fsS --max-time 8 --get --data-urlencode \"query=count by (instance) (node_uname_info)\" http://127.0.0.1:10902/api/v1/query","observation":"Current query returned exactly four logical series, instances node1:9100 through node4:9100, with no replica label in the result."},{"node":"node3","command":"timeout 20s /usr/local/bin/thanos tools bucket ls --objstore.config-file=/etc/thanos/objstore.yml --log.level=error","observation":"Authenticated Thanos object-store access succeeded and listed 14 retained block IDs."},{"node":"node3","command":"curl -fsS --max-time 12 --get --data-urlencode \"query=count by (instance) (node_uname_info)\" --data-urlencode \"time=1787709847\" http://127.0.0.1:10902/api/v1/query","observation":"Historical instant query at 1787709847 returned the same four host instances; the query store metadata reported a store range covering that timestamp."},{"node":"node3","command":"sudo -H sh -c '. /root/thanos-objectstore.env; case \"$S3_ENDPOINT\" in https://*) printf \"endpoint_scheme=https\\n\";; *) printf \"endpoint_scheme=not-https\\n\";; esac; printf \"ca_file=%s\\n\" \"$S3_CA_CERT\"; grep -E \"^(type:|  bucket:|  endpoint:|  insecure:|    ca_file:|  access_key:|  secret_key:[REDACTED]    cert_file:)\" /etc/thanos/objstore.yml | sed -E \"s/((access|secret)_key|password|token):.*/\\1: <redacted>/I\"; stat -c \"%a %U %G\" /root/thanos-objectstore.env'","observation":"Object configuration reported HTTPS, bucket thanos-metrics, endpoint node4:9000, insecure:false, and a CA file; /root/thanos-objectstore.env was mode 600 root:root."},{"node":"node4","command":"curl -skS --max-time 5 -o /dev/null -w \"https_status=%{http_code}\\n\" https://127.0.0.1:9000/thanos-metrics/","observation":"Unauthenticated HTTPS access returned 403, confirming the object store requires authentication."}],"failures":[],"limitations":[]},{"id":"thanos-state-clean","status":"fail","summary":"Required monitoring processes were present without failed units or duplicates, but enabled SSH socket exposure and a remaining temporary file violate the authored clean-state condition.","evidence":[{"node":"node1","command":"systemctl --failed --no-legend 2>/dev/null; ps -eo user=,pid=,comm= --sort=comm | grep -E \"prometheus|prometheus-node|thanos|minio\" | grep -v grep || true","observation":"No failed units; one Prometheus, one node exporter, and one Thanos sidecar process were present."},{"node":"node2","command":"systemctl --failed --no-legend 2>/dev/null; ps -eo user=,pid=,comm= --sort=comm | grep -E \"prometheus|prometheus-node|thanos|minio\" | grep -v grep || true","observation":"No failed units; one Prometheus, one node exporter, and one Thanos sidecar process were present."},{"node":"node3","command":"systemctl --failed --no-legend 2>/dev/null; ps -eo user=,pid=,comm= --sort=comm | grep -E \"prometheus|prometheus-node|thanos|minio\" | grep -v grep || true","observation":"No failed units; one node exporter and the Thanos query, store, and compactor processes were present."},{"node":"node4","command":"systemctl --failed --no-legend 2>/dev/null; ps -eo user=,pid=,comm= --sort=comm | grep -E \"prometheus|prometheus-node|thanos|minio\" | grep -v grep || true","observation":"No failed units; one MinIO process and one node exporter were present."},{"node":"node3","command":"systemctl is-enabled ssh.socket 2>&1; systemctl is-active ssh.socket 2>&1; systemctl show -p Listen,Accept ssh.socket 2>/dev/null","observation":"ssh.socket was enabled and active, listening on 0.0.0.0:22 and [::]:22."},{"node":"node3","command":"find /tmp /var/tmp -xdev -maxdepth 3 -type f -printf \"%m %u %g %p\\n\" 2>/dev/null | sort","observation":"A remaining temporary file /tmp/verify was present, mode 644 and owned by root:root."}],"failures":[],"limitations":[]}],"actions_performed":["Executed Probe 1 with 9 read-only managed exec calls.","Executed Probe 2 with 5 read-only managed exec calls.","Performed no mutations, recovery actions, or cleanup because all probes were read-only.","Called mcp__infraset__complete_evidence exactly once after all live checks."],"overall_summary":"The metrics contract passes: two replicas scrape all four hosts, Thanos deduplicates current series, and retained object blocks serve historical data over authenticated HTTPS. Operational state fails because node3 has an enabled active SSH socket and residual /tmp/verify."}
